# CA operators whose roots a lite image keeps (#2508). filter-ca-bundle.py
# keeps every root in overlay/etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt whose subject
# O= starts with one of these lines, and drops the rest. Ultimate and every
# other variant ship Mozilla's whole store.
#
# Names rather than fingerprints, so a Mozilla refresh (#2501) flows through:
# a new root from a kept operator is kept without anyone touching this file.
# An entry that matches nothing fails the build -- it means a refresh renamed
# or dropped that operator, and on the ISRG or USERTrust line that is sysupgrade
# losing GitHub.
#
# 53 of 121 roots, 42 KB of xz where the full store is 103 KB. Each line names
# what was verified to chain to it on 2026-10-03; the rest are kept because
# they issue for a large share of public sites.
#
# A camera that needs a dropped root can append its PEM to
# /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt. That copy lives on the overlay and
# shadows every later refresh of the image's bundle until it is removed, and
# a root mbedTLS cannot parse stops majestic at startup.

